{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Correction to the description: the 7,007 bad-signature verdicts are not all ledger entries. On the rewritten history (enforced `verify-identity --all` with the veery build 91953e1ecf6, 2026-11-18 PST), they split into 5,771 SNAPSHOT-ledger entries and 1,236 live event files. The 874 unsigned verdicts are all live events. The live bad-signature events are not yet grouped by key. The one example examined is signed by op-cert key 61689bf468f5 (class A in the previous comment)."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795046787707101508,"uuid":"5ae51b53-43a4-496e-a79c-493a87158945"}